      <p>Extend your Zanzibar beach holiday with a mainland Tanzanian safari. Popular options include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Serengeti National Park:</strong> 2–3 day fly-in safaris, witness the Great Migration (June–October)</li>
        <li><strong>Ngorongoro Crater:</strong> 1–2 day tours, world's highest density of wildlife</li>
        <li><strong>Tarangire National Park:</strong> 1–2 day tours, famous for elephant herds and baobab trees</li>
      </ul>
      <p>All safaris include licensed guides, park fees, and 4x4 transport. Fly from ZNZ to Arusha, then drive to the park.</p>
